	(text "R10: always-on GPS J410 and radio J420. DB1254pos pins1 PORT_4V8,2 GND,3 board TX,4 board RX; harness crosses TX to endpoint RX."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 26a75c96-ffbc-5db5-aa06-c6ec09e73f5d))
	(text "GPS USART6 PC6 TX / PC7 RX AF7; radio UART5 PB13 TX / PB12 RX AF14 (ST DS12110 Rev11 Table10 p91 PB12/PB13, p92 PC6/PC7). Direct MCU UART through1k and ground-only ESD; no EN/OE/FAULT GPIOs."
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 579bbb63-3f35-524b-a20a-edbe58a56b0b))
	(text "RX FT_h / FT_u: digital0..5V only, pulls disabled throughout use. Operating pull limit is relevant IO supply+0.3V (DS12110 Rev11 Table112 n3 p210 / Table147 n6 p242), distinct from Table109 absolute stress. Board off: no self-powered module;1k is not powered-off isolation."
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid b29f844e-939c-5f1e-9c83-cdba205f1cad))
	(text "J430 Molex472192001 is a locking hinged microSD socket, no eject spring or card-detect switch. SPI3 PC10/11/12 AF6, PD0 software CS with10k pull-up. QSPI remains the crash-safe primary log."
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid e585120a-9377-5b71-9019-6369e791c15a))
	(text "Card pins1 DAT2,2 CS,3 MOSI/CMD,4 3V3,5 SCK,6 GND,7 MISO/DAT0,8 DAT1; four shield tabs to GND. R460-R46410k pull-ups on CS/CMD/DAT0/DAT1/DAT2; C460100nF plus C46122uF at card supply; no SCK pull."
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid be0c0a4b-896e-5082-9364-863c245f8e08))
	(text "Power-up SD: CS high, MOSI high, >=74 clocks at100-400kHz; enter SPI with CMD0. Limit run clock<=25MHz, card write<=200mA and idle<=30mA as bench-qualified allocations. No blocking card operation in flight; card removal only with board off."
		(at 20.32 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 8adb2d79-26cc-5a61-a047-68c1ff583350))
	(text "ROM loader drives PC11 SPI3_MISO while CS stays high throughR460; card must remain deselected. Disable synchronous trace because PC12 can be TRACED3. CS high before AF6 configuration."
		(at 20.32 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid e18f78ff-9277-5565-808d-db85a8918abd))
	(text "Radio messages may never arm/fire. LR900-F band890-915MHz: use channels12-25(902-915MHz) or maker-confirmed FHSS set. Bench-qualify installed RF immunity."
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 37f4c018-7f66-57dd-b2e4-8c36ee17eeec))
	(text "J410/J420 are unkeyedgreenDB1253.5mm4posC2757925. Labelpower/GND/TX/RXperpin; clamp28-16AWGqualifiedferrules/splices, verifypolarity andharnesscrossing beforepower. Thinnermoduleleadsmustnotbeclampeddirectly."
		(at 20.32 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid d030325e-0839-557d-9810-13f0ccc7977e))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "15"))))
